From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:16:48 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 182/297] Meridian: MCP calls don't hang on a frozen or busy
 tab, nor wait in line

The tab an agent works in is woken and kept awake (not frozen or throttled
in the background) for a few minutes after its last call; a page that
doesn't answer in 20 s is a tool error saying so (wait_for within its own
time); the MCP bridge runs each tool call on its own thread, so a call that
waits doesn't hold up the others.

